<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela to auction 17 real estate properties.</title>
<headline>Venezuela to auction 17 real estate properties.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's Deposits Guarantee Fund (Fogade) said it will auction 17 real estate properties on January 29 at a minimum price of 1.49 billion bolivars ($3.13 million).</p>
<p>The properties, all acquired during the 1994-95 banking crisis, are located in the capital Caracas and in the states of Aragua, Barinas, Carabobo, Miranda and Tachira. They include commercial and apartment buildings and land.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
